v6.12.0 11th November 2026

- Updated for PyQt v6.12.1 and Qt v6.12.0.
- `sip2rst.py` now warns about missing image files rather than treating it as
  an error.


v6.11.0 30th March 2026

- Updated for PyQt v6.11.0 and Qt v6.11.0.


v6.10.1 11th November 2025

- The `QRangeModel`, `QPyAbstractRange`, `QPySequenceRange` and
  `QPyTableRange` classes are documented.
- The section on contributing to the documentation has been updated in the
  light of the move to GitHub.
- The `README` file is now in markdown format.
- Added the `NEWS` file.
